  "notes": "A distinctive decision-support layout. The main schedule is a single-day resource timeline: confirmed bookings are navy blocks, past ones are faded, clean-down gaps are diagonal hatching labelled 'CLEAN', and a red 'Now 1:10 PM' line runs through every row. Proposed changes from the selected option appear as dashed green ghost blocks ('Arlo Goods (moved)', 'Lena +90 min'), or as a red hatched conflict when you pick blocked option A. The right panel lists 'Three ways to answer' as one-open-at-a-time accordion options with lettered colored squares (A red, B green, C navy). Each carries an outcome pill (Blocked / Works · 2 moves / Works · Lena to confirm) and expands into a checklist of constraint checks with ✓ and ✗ marks plus an Apply button. The 'Up next' arrival cards re-render to preview the chosen option, with an amber or red highlight on the affected card."
